  "body": "Ideally we'd have a place for compat stuff like this which offered some minimal IP protection so that more people could participate (eg. Microsoft, Facebook).  Should we consider moving this to, for example, a WICG repo?  I believe absolutely everything else could remain completely the same.\r\n\r\nIf things [come up](https://twitter.com/miketaylr/status/834540910989959174) before we can/want to make this decision, any objection to starting a philosophically identical spec in the WICG?  Then we can leave rationalizing the two \"compat\" specs down to a single one as a parallel exercise?  IMHO everything in the compat spec ideally belongs in some other spec anyway (whether the editors of that spec see it that way or not). So really we're just doing \"incubation\" :smile: ",
